<section class="editorial-hero section-pad"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE KNOW-HOW.</span><h1>Find your fit.<br><em>Love them longer.</em></h1><p>One size, all the details. Here’s what to know about Mystic Clouds.</p></section>
<section class="info-columns section-pad"><div class="prose"><h2>Let’s talk fit.</h2><p>Mystic Clouds is a crew sock in one size. The flat foot length is 22 cm, with stretch from the knit. A flat measurement is not the same as a shoe-size conversion.</p><div class="notice">{{ section.settings.fit | escape }}</div><table><caption>Finished flat measurements · SO-MYS-001</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Measurement</th><th scope="col">Target</th><th scope="col">Tolerance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Foot length</th><td>22 cm</td><td>±1 cm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Leg length</th><td>22 cm</td><td>±1 cm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cuff width</th><td>8.5 cm</td><td>±0.5 cm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cuff height</th><td>3.5 cm</td><td>±0.2 cm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Heel depth</th><td>4.5 cm</td><td>±0.5 cm</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="prose"><h2>Good care starts<br>with the label.</h2><p>{{ section.settings.care | escape }}</p><h3>What goes into them</h3><p>{{ section.settings.materials | escape }}</p><h3>What makes the difference</h3><p>168-needle jacquard construction. Combed cotton face yarn. Reinforced heel and toe. Hand-linked seamless toe closure.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/help">Need a hand with sizing? {% render 'arrow' %}</a></div></section>
